      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Conjure a dome, impenetrable to monsters. Lasts indefinitely, but requires 24 power/s.[#]() [#](53341a)**Required offerings:** **Obsidian**, **Redstone**.[#]() [#](53341a)**Optional focus:** **Bound Waystone**. Optional items have a gold frame on the rite card.[#]()",
      "title": "Monster ward",
